// Replacing the private key secret
/**
Get-Content ..\..\..\private\dev-private-keys\private-worker-crud-operations-2.pem -Raw |
  pnpm wrangler secret put CRUD_WORKER_PRIVATE_KEY --config .\crud-worker.jsonc

--- Expected output ---
>>   pnpm wrangler secret put CRUD_WORKER_PRIVATE_KEY --config .\crud-worker.jsonc
[WARN] The "pnpm" field in package.json is no longer read by pnpm. The following keys were ignored: "pnpm.onlyBuiltDependencies". See https://pnpm.io/settings for the new home of each setting.

 ⛅️ wrangler 4.92.0 (update available 4.95.0)
─────────────────────────────────────────────
🌀 Creating the secret for the Worker "crud-worker"
✨ Success! Uploaded secret CRUD_WORKER_PRIVATE_KEY
